# Best Practices

When implementing Azure Monitor:

- Collect only the telemetry required for operational and security objectives.
- Use Data Collection Rules to standardize data collection.
- Enable Diagnostic Settings for critical Azure resources.
- Review log retention policies regularly.
- Monitor ingestion costs and optimize data collection where appropriate.
- Protect access to monitoring resources using Role-Based Access Control (RBAC).

